        </svg>
        How to Connect WhatsApp Accounts (QR Code &amp; Phone Pairing)
      </h2>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
      Navigate to <a href="/whatsapp/connect" style="color: var(--text-accent); font-weight: 600;">Manage Accounts</a>. If you have no accounts connected, click <strong>+ Link WhatsApp Account</strong> or the <strong>+ Add Account</strong> card. You can choose either of two pairing methods:
    </p>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem;">
      <!-- Method 1: QR Code -->
      <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 1.25rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
          <span class="badge badge-success">Method 1</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;">Scan QR Code</h3>
        </div>
        <ol class="instructions-list" style="margin-left: 0.5rem;">
          <li><div>Open <strong>WhatsApp</strong> on your mobile device.</div></li>
          <li><div>Tap <strong>Settings</strong> (iOS) or <strong>Three Dots ⋮</strong> (Android) &gt; <strong>Linked Devices</strong>.</div></li>
          <li><div>Tap <strong>Link a Device</strong> and point your camera at the live QR code displayed in the modal.</div></li>
          <li><div>Once scanned, the account connects automatically and saves to your dashboard.</div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <!-- Method 2: Phone Pairing Code -->
      <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 1.25rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
          <span class="badge badge-info">Method 2</span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;">Pair with Phone Number</h3>
        </div>
        <ol class="instructions-list" style="margin-left: 0.5rem;">
          <li><div>In the pairing modal, click the <strong>Pair with Phone Number</strong> tab.</div></li>
          <li><div>Enter your full phone number with country code (e.g. <code>+8801712345678</code> or <code>+12025550199</code>) and click <strong>⚡ Get Code</strong>.</div></li>
          <li><div>An official 8-digit pairing code (e.g. <code>1234-5678</code>) will be generated instantly.</div></li>
          <li><div>On your phone: open WhatsApp &gt; <strong>Linked Devices</strong> &gt; <strong>Link a Device</strong> &gt; tap <strong>Link with phone number instead</strong> at the bottom.</div></li>
          <li><div>Enter the 8-character code. The session immediately authorizes and connects!</div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

